{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "batch": 1564,
  "batch_count": 1674,
  "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
  "source_commit": "c0843a2d48250bf43b290794d39bc866bb741857",
  "source_language": "zh-CN",
  "entries": [
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:18c8220e3ee063521b3884dc",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "真想干脆穿着睡衣去上课……",
      "source_fingerprint": "92308b0996aa44a4d93b79d422422a1570c2f40aeee28d4676381363086ac19d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1145",
        "71010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0fef2035dcfd450ab79cea58",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "跳舞要是当作游戏来看，倒也过得去。",
      "source_fingerprint": "8692e043271966fe939ee3210abaf2c5532da8fd7252e50b160878eb1b10ef6d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1145",
        "71014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f725acc6652ade3d054a17de",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "你，也想在我的掌心起舞吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "e13ee8b12650f7362d938f0741121efab31ec78c09e514e2e300c02397b72899",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1145",
        "71015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:29bd6714708726d09f5c090d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "说到衣服，穿起来舒不舒服才是最重要的。",
      "source_fingerprint": "36ff36e884f887f2a56ccc91f133d550689575b3a63d30708bf8e6db721666ca",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1145",
        "71018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:13031e8f8f1ea9c4e414b39c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "更衣所耗费的精力自然是越少越好。",
      "source_fingerprint": "78cc0ea2def4a3747bef2c03c6d88445b944591aa57d6881039a1559b8fd4daf",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1145",
        "71019"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e1c8061375dbe545f81f394e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "辛苦了",
      "source_fingerprint": "bd96bf364b8b21a3bb94efcf4ef82feb1bc34cf02203524e7949dbd19151dd13",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1145",
        "80000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:79a92e8a4bfca3e326a6d7a4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "红茶、咖啡，我都喝……\r\n不过早晨还是偏爱港式奶茶啊。\r\n推演思路的清晰度完全不一样。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f6f4a6d19397eb103dd0063254aa1d119df9b29358a08f2e6b7d21e9336176de",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1145",
        "90000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ce836aec5e9b8fe1107804b8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "肾上腺素在不断激涌……\r\n状态简直嗨到不行……！――不，\r\n并不是睡得好。而是通宵了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "3f564cc21461aed0024064884e018c7e27d76504c454adfd0f933d57d4325d77",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1145",
        "90001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5b70cfd318f35e6941ae013f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "分析名人的对局棋谱时\r\n有了很有趣的发现。啊，上课\r\n什么的无所谓，研究这个有意义得多。",
      "source_fingerprint": "936d99672d197e95199cf0234d179dcea06016fee9c9f6fb36096d388e91d7fd",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1145",
        "90002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a37e2a44b9ee7898060203b5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "休息是关乎玩家士气的\r\n重大事宜。你也明白的吧。\r\n――那我能直接回家了吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "347958695046e30dccd69d763887971f89e28d2ccb9fb6a8855e14bfa80e8c28",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1145",
        "90003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4c43ba72ade4bcbbee3bd4cf",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "夜晚的宁静真好。既不会打扰长考，\n预读推演也能磨砺得更敏锐……\n最适合玩桌游了。这就是我是个夜猫子的原因。",
      "source_fingerprint": "9493a4b96320da31bca7d0feeb08e597b2397098e720ba8e5b665d02dd234295",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1145",
        "90004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:734a545860b2599ea471aed5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "宿舍门禁嘛……好歹有在遵守……\n要是晚了，神威会担心得不得了\n吵吵嚷嚷的可麻烦了……",
      "source_fingerprint": "2e7f3fdd396241405589779010b6e00b78f1500a9352055df8cf912dfc39ccbc",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1145",
        "90005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:943965650517c0b7a8cebc0b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我很同情这个时节的自然界啊。\r\n被迫发芽，被迫飞向外界。\r\n宛如弃子一般可悲呢……",
      "source_fingerprint": "336c8090621ce7a9295c139a1bc4f2f70337791910ca0f5a6ca678704783a85f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1145",
        "90006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:150d58fe63e539ad9015c1b1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "紫外线、中暑、脱水……有个能防止\r\n所有死局的究极秘策――\r\n穴熊围，也就是闭门不出室内派！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d9e327cf66cb3a7674a3f540869c896278e6d54d9c9379f9c61f9acbe32957ee",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1145",
        "90007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:710dc598b43ee879deb72b3e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我家每年都会例行去温泉旅馆赏红叶。\r\n风雅的庭园真是……\r\n呃不，一直在玩桌游完全没印象了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "bdfbdb8d3cf247818e55d21bf8011d2f154294c672cbe383e07658acc2f13710",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1145",
        "90008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b2049bb6bc540d2d38f793a7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "冬天果然还是甜食最好吃啊。\r\n冰淇淋、巧克力……根据地的\r\n冰箱果然还是太小了啊……换个大的吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "380a4b1c39fc5d7d965e1cd22678e2807556897dd0822b5ac19b9bf59e982a00",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1145",
        "90009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1fc9da86f967592ce77b21f1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "情人节快乐啊",
      "source_fingerprint": "b7158b79125613d724fac5e21a37ea5b96ec1a17e66423d4a70e9e96acbc5d87",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1145",
        "90020"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:247b25587640f779dfb43cb0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "玫瑰在国际象棋上的造诣相当深厚哦。\r\n虽然她谦虚地说是“略懂一二”……\r\n但那绝对是在虚张声势虚晃一枪呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "24a693c2ab64978d3467240fb98e096c75c4605a80fdd8bbe209a74ef43b12e1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1145",
        "91000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0af7fa83b152af46ab73943e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "比萨这家伙……明明长了张天使般的脸，\r\n抽卡运简直离谱得要命……！\r\n不对，正因为是天使所以才运气爆棚吗……！？",
      "source_fingerprint": "42c9c08d084c185ab51863c4a50821b2a63ba1625000d489e0fc468914f6b7ae",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1145",
        "91001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9444e560bf26ef4aecf36165",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "父母从小就很尊重我的兴趣。\r\n特意给我建了个用来玩齿轮墙的\r\n房间时，我还真吃了一惊呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "dee40500587030ddbea9bd0d933de0f95cafac77bf4cfbd919c1f280fa4e3c1c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1145",
        "91002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ac61965dc412455eda78518d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "从现在起禁止说外来语词汇。我来\n带你练习词语类桌游。……刚才\n还没开始，所以不算犯规哦。",
      "source_fingerprint": "55052d8b9a379158cf0f17efb172025db2bf5043ed0aaed69646fa0653e113b1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1145",
        "91003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5c988d897aa17b8351f56c2b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "出门前的准备绝对是世界上\r\n最麻烦的事了……一边换衣服\r\n一边甚至都会冒出想回家的念头……",
      "source_fingerprint": "32cddd3b467e791d5455d3ee0b497111e08c3b1c9bad743e9bd12f272d964ce8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1145",
        "91004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:aea17c06a9d55307649c642b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "即便身着同样的服饰，统治者的\n风度也是会自然流露出来的……\n正如国际象棋中的国王那样。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b44682848181c21b3f63f0c492ae2202c14a52b9b6e27483b98bbd105bdcd6ca",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1145",
        "91005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1043c661b258f3309caffb58",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "演唱会亦是掌控人心的一处局面……\n将舞台与观众的心尽收囊中，\n拿下这一回合吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "dd38980ae5f20e3d52d29c529df52b1a3c7fe5cfadc699c0ea1863ebe2e96cbd",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1145",
        "91006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8f98c087b1b0775a42b5e89c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "刻意削减色彩信息，\r\n彻底追求极致简约的造型之美……\r\n这就是黑白色调的绝妙之处。",
      "source_fingerprint": "8eeb9eb1e3d8945979b61326ae830f96f85a791d06dd20820e69eed7fa523205",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1145",
        "91007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0afd3e70da64bd4581b8ab5e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "虽然是以功能性优先……但与此同时\r\n时髦帅气也是不可或缺的。\r\n我可是非常讲究这之间的平衡的。",
      "source_fingerprint": "6f9adaedd5fc752892c5661180f84d9d0fe3a2d692970330fb39d5a60ff0ac7a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1145",
        "91008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a6e3aca83d216c2776ad501d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "啊――好困……大清早的神威怎么\n那么有精神啊……大嗓门吵得我\n回笼觉都被糟蹋了不是吗……",
      "source_fingerprint": "ff50fc012e3e8acae3f8c9b698841915db39c510f9382cc90681df25f4b6583d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1145",
        "91009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0d506a3f2caf5524d5dd2f1b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "气槽发了一大堆LANE过来……\n午饭吃了吗，作业交了吗……\n全是唠叨！！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "dc814cc00b3b1e64938d95096eaf150a23e33e58dfc7711ddbd751005097de36",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1145",
        "91010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fdbdb3bc52bbf40d0c76191c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "一天过得真是一瞬间啊……和比萨\n她们玩变则黑白棋玩得太热火朝天，\n时间简直光速蒸发了……",
      "source_fingerprint": "98d3f6c7bc8fcde611540857a31f39dc881b59b8cb849eac7e67c749387ed3b4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1145",
        "91011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7ac17eb60eb2d5115c613325",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "在众人都沉溺于春日融融的时节，\r\n正是趁虚而入打出缓手的好机会……开玩笑的。\r\n利用环境也是战略的一部分。",
      "source_fingerprint": "0ef114436adf998529c4f3f0deacbfd7506b1092d18175d6f1d4e455e85d17bf",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1145",
        "91012"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2b2f8c698741285ec3a55eef",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "偶尔玩玩恐怖类桌游也不错呢。\r\n你也来陪我嘛，\r\n你总不会说自己害怕吧？",
      "source_fingerprint": "2ceaf14799a6777e3045fad270fa584071aa0389ef90a17ce3a1628f835f82b9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1145",
        "91013"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:01bf6580ea2787838d504b92",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "读书之秋吗……心理学书籍也很有\r\n意思哦。你要不要也学习一下？\r\n说不定能让战术更加精进呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "dc3f2cae3e87c65736dc585dcb7e63b5907262e2aaff01049c856258f4bfbe12",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1145",
        "91014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:737dc9c6f667533f07a42b71",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我知道我的根据地缺少什么了……\n是闪耀学姐亲手做的\n苹果派外卖系统……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "69a93081b79583c87c2ea286e52660653509e3c814be00dce8f02d8350fe01fb",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1145",
        "91015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3af0d85348099842d81bf46b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "战略没有漏洞吧？可别一不留神\r\n就变成了叠兵……\r\n必须无懈可击地把方案推演到极致。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a902d254ce0493e0edc8d7f6df5128b975045879faaa56fb6188470ea4a2adb0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1145",
        "92000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7d2d15fcf1814d158a606f88",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "及时更新情报是铁则。\r\n对手的行动有变动吗？\r\n有的话立刻告诉我。",
      "source_fingerprint": "8d60d31a54a4134289199c468260918202fb139085ea73c2e3d44223a5588e01",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1145",
        "92001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f95ce78ac4096a8dbca92143",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "以更高效率、毫无浪费的最少步数\r\n取得胜利……这正是我们的\r\n目标所在。漂亮利落地拿下吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "7e2e2f2bfe12dca3806320e7285c8ff50522f6e163d23f0117b8e477af57636a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1145",
        "92002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:06c840f9b2542ad2dba85951",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我的同期都是一众强者……上一代\r\n也尽是难缠的对手。呵……有意思，\r\n我有预感这会成为一场名局。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2d6db1737c62b32e4f5f78b1133ba57fef5de1f646fb7bc2f41045d5101c9fb2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1145",
        "92003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cda85cbb028827a8622f5f54",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "你扮演我的左右手也越来越\n得心应手了呢。对于我每一步棋的意图，\n你现在也能完全心领神会了吧？",
      "source_fingerprint": "94a2dc133cb606ed31e32658b67e72f142ef688f4e9bf4a3076bc3763ca04bfe",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1145",
        "92005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3220fb677ceaca91437d4461",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "最近干劲一直很稳定。\r\n嗯，这也少不了你的功劳。\r\n这记妙手，你就自豪地收下吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ba75f95b7419b6390c05ae56d191dcfcca1c9807656e17c50bc6355ef879fe8f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1145",
        "92006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1ca244c3068c5cbeea42e209",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "你对我还真是打心底里着迷呢。\r\n哈哈，想藏也是白费力气，\r\n全都从你的训练菜单里流露出来了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "287999e347d28ad533db75ffbc76ddb41184f8c90a07397117df840a49789c64",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1145",
        "92007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:577088a5974e8107116c6015",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "夏天去度假……不过是新手的\r\n说辞罢了。我能走出更高明的妙招……\r\n趁这个机会全身心投入桌游中去。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a10bf739b0090a1582f3d7704de3aca8888c3a6f682a023448834f83dc1ecc4c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1145",
        "92011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fb250c44fa0f67e732de4e47",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我的左右手绝对非你莫属――我的眼光没错吧？",
      "source_fingerprint": "6c6e3e11c1e1700cc2a277de21928c902a86cf13be2ebec63c644c2f5ba96b3e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1145",
        "93000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1338009c0a646d9bf5fd3abe",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "一同挑战的游戏，不知不觉就沉迷进去了呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f012cf94e497ca1c0bc52f39f475130d79efe978a4676b973ee79b75bfc16c04",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1145",
        "93001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cad29d1e7dac5a5267981116",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "棋步推进得很顺畅呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "14c139d59e3cdd17dfade9548595e6cbfabea3bcadc6c01d495069bb6662da3b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1145",
        "95000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5e117736e811d6fac4561c9c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我的战术绝不存在极限……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "1a821fe8e1e13319b7111eadf3f1e739368541770546b81c83a97f6d71978d81",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1145",
        "95001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:399b67e66992a2acd33e06bc",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我是统治地位。来吧，开始游戏吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "6d8d06791db9b5cf89335c58472f14399182c335deb8ef8f8adc531240a2bdc6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1145",
        "95003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:67dcec2633f7242e827d05a8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "盘面尽在我掌中――\r\n看我华丽地支配全场！",
      "source_fingerprint": "f9c8b3ea23296f2bae19ad9e00b619a4c31ac3a075dc8c6807d4e2f11ac04a00",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1145",
        "95004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7ed09283cb5bcc69c9de24ec",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "新阶段的帷幕拉开了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "fbde2f111b015868fdd248d7f87e7ae8ffb7a3201efc98ced0e6a4ae333eea2c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1145",
        "95006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:229347af824aea1e24d47df5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "出发吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b0e503174d4061b5a441fdf881cb3104cb5ae97793c7d54f43b96980f665783a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1149",
        "1000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8c9d884e59f4f826256e8150",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "既会向晚辈请求拜师，\r\n又会提出些出人意料的建议……\r\n呵……你这人还真是，意外地不拘一格啊。",
      "source_fingerprint": "306dbb7f8551d7f2e0cac1a4a1fe9576a089d9eb26bac2640cd7b0fc730f25fa",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1149",
        "10000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8fff1dd5d1e6b532a2f1c7cf",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我出发了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "874e7497e7be8367a4f334f4c7f1d69916bd93469660e8935829876ff0311191",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1149",
        "100000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9a4026e1daa1529c49aebd2f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我回来了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "4f3f071de3a132d55ed31edf557b362afda8ef29b618fd0f52a13920ed7d26bb",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1149",
        "100001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9a7895ea085883f1886d6640",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "虽然还有不少稚嫩之处……但你\r\n很有潜力。……这把薙刀的保养，\r\n说不定以后还会交给你呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "fab90b4fe874ad11bcb7051abf5ad2683ad08f4063482cc73ef6e22bb98a3c90",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1149",
        "10001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2505daa2f2cc6a5fa118ccd6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哼——越是那些不畏苦难、向阳而生，\r\n不断向上伸展的嫩芽……\r\n才越有让人默默守护的价值啊。",
      "source_fingerprint": "186f6ebe5dbf01000ab5390ee548992e1fb5ff4568648a8f82a12a80b21d7f18",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1149",
        "10002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ae2d8a7fa68c2d504b5b4711",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "新年快乐。\r\n我稍后要去俱乐部打声招呼。\r\n你也一起来吧。大家都在等你。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e9f1b812a2a8144a171799a17ed952fd570db8e1adc41fe591b735b3dd10d6af",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1149",
        "10003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:42b05c249ffc1f9e669fa7cf",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "能借用一下训练员室的\r\n冰箱吗？我收到了巧克力……\r\n不想让大家的心意融化掉。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c665274400df6206a4a0057b3fedf25d5657e62d1abb230de3b8b3dad24861cb",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1149",
        "10004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0a289fe6157c509a0a10478b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "本想送些点心……但如果是花的话，\r\n能更长久地治愈你吧？\r\n……况且蝴蝶兰尤其不易枯萎。",
      "source_fingerprint": "7b6d82a304f9d88c29af91e44de2538d9e5fa2348eaf6be8dd7b54ab3f6675ea",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1149",
        "10005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1aceab25f9feda845f861e3f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "直接仰望夜空固然好……但偶尔，\r\n也试着看看水镜中倒映的星空吧。\r\n那随风摇曳的银河别有一番风味哦。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c8e111ffc07980d53d7512a00010865537c464a880d1785bdcc9945dc1bda233",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1149",
        "10006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a9cbf3caaec2373096d6bec7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "不给糖就捣蛋？\r\n哦……打算对为师恶作剧吗\r\n——有气魄。我接受你的挑战。",
      "source_fingerprint": "36051ba884e08012159eb1a512fc6a1ad49813306d8e3542ee65a277859a7e79",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1149",
        "10007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ec3bfbd6c08ca076b90e7591",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我自幼便没什么物欲。\r\n每到这个时节，父母年年都会\r\n面露难色……就像现在的你一样？",
      "source_fingerprint": "1e6e6d6d759b1ce3bb546aa4cff339f7f7c98377190873361699e18d2353fe73",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1149",
        "10008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e220122c673642a6b6634ea9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "今年嘛……我想想，我想要花。\r\n野花也无妨。……请告诉我，\r\n现在的你觉得什么花最美。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d789353e7ce9efe9ec17f23cc20f1f833246a02f150d2e6a2e209dbd5c318d08",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1149",
        "10009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e2c380ed4fd6ee90ae478e07",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "那是自然。",
      "source_fingerprint": "8b1f314746552184897439de9c8c0473065d97f64cabf90ef920441fc7ec3364",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1149",
        "1001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8416222752dc51f4f830ae4d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "每当开始扫除道场上的积灰，\r\n就能深切感受到年末将至呢。……那么，\r\n接下来该扫除训练员室的积灰了吧？",
      "source_fingerprint": "8802b29c630f512bb7d6a61be1c00d092bbbf5baa11549801d338032df8196d7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1149",
        "10010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1c6a653816d653d5467dca13",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "恭贺生辰之喜。……今年\r\n也能这般为你庆生，我感到很高兴。\r\n愿你安康。无论到何时。",
      "source_fingerprint": "6d3b19e68099051729c5fc30d539eea48ebed2b87903579cea5907598c5efda4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1149",
        "10011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bae302713b1dc395106f8c0e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "今天早点把工作收尾，\r\n去休息吧。……今天是你的生日吧。\r\n至少在这样的日子，多犒劳一下自己。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e652c3754a4d2c4ec27fa4e8d71391443f7e4fc279c42beedce3f3d63e98f182",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1149",
        "10012"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ea85dda89182a1601661b008",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "生日礼物吗……既然如此，\r\n就把时间分出来用于自我锻炼吧。\r\n你的成长，就是最好的礼物。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a5b60e16c52c57c5c5ba743c0d641a5dcabeff21ef4190fa7e40a6300882499e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1149",
        "10013"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1a91cf2109364d896f4e6151",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "能够遇见你这位同志，\r\n我已别无所求。\r\n……什么，非要我想一个？……这可难办了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "04f7c556c236c635a614877de553371028017e8edff2990d7e570db9404670fd",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1149",
        "10014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:609d492611d21f87c34a8345",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "有通知来了。\r\n记得尽早过目。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d3e2fb16f665b3fdc327f30e7cb8dbb42895f2d2ce2cb86886f7a551e9b45097",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1149",
        "10015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ac4790ffab97fda465e2b077",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "礼物寄到了。\r\n这份厚意，就让我们郑重收下吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "0bb5861c80d40349a43f57269511d51d6a39d3f3508f35baa555b834589c7f5e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1149",
        "10016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b70e175b4594075ae4b90f6d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "任务达成了。\r\n干得好。下次也要继续努力。",
      "source_fingerprint": "8fbdb17155b86c9c63004c90b441bfd7d617cbb90e05218df6ee3133beae0399",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1149",
        "10017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ce88110964853bd0effdfb75",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "近期似乎有活动。\r\n若有机会，要去露个面吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "62218f809ded6d2f33ca28a2c70ceed2e3429b12d3eab1d52fd19532b39396a6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1149",
        "10018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3e02c9a13d2d2e3113e113c0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "活动正在举办中。\r\n如果是你的话，定能取得好成绩。\r\n带着自信去挑战吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "096c8ce15737864c35d7f7d902482c59f53f28887f76724acbe88bef1efc3d74",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1149",
        "10019"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:88468217b6dbe4aea5341ac5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "唔……只有一线之隔吗！",
      "source_fingerprint": "8a03563e812a489f4c8bf7b5a2883f7d9e12bf9093d083401323081096bcd1bd",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1149",
        "1002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9791a874dd0a6c9b6d015afb",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "名鉴等级似乎提升了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "9fa58b8d9d676ccdff6f319a973a696a186cfc24e60d1b2b6c0b0b1c0e4c058b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1149",
        "10021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:827351a46b1614289dc1e6e6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "本来想挑便于调节体温的衣服……\r\n但有时也会仅凭设计来选择。\r\n就像这件一样。",
      "source_fingerprint": "7254e3b4d0caca1881fbdd8c2d30d8179d603f95f57ebf1fc7f1440a3cf1eb58",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1149",
        "10025"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a62b5f131212a70e3f8cb5f8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "大家似乎总觉得我平时\r\n只穿和服。所以我穿这身衣服时，\r\n大多会让人吃一惊……呵，真愉快啊。",
      "source_fingerprint": "8799ee4ce05dc7bb4f09c634d5b9895fab8bf6e46ebccd7c6db438719178dffc",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1149",
        "10026"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d3a9d07760945e3f6788920f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "……毛皮是不是有些塌了？\r\n单靠梳理已经到极限了吗……\r\n最近还得再拿去保养一下啊。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a27bd642db9c72d919514c5f7da79419b2ab8e4dff3153060d3cb0a4124e6674",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1149",
        "10027"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3bacc212efc7c45ae55fc4df",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哼，干得不错。",
      "source_fingerprint": "1c0b1bcb8e755314b80b629da17b4adbeb29b96d15535f443bf1cbffb0231054",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1149",
        "1003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e02678d8821598ec110cfc8b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "奏响胜利的凯歌吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "63b2f0a82a3bbd9dfdc16aabf933bf11307a25fa72d41d3f83e1e5cd5c52b342",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1149",
        "1004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1ce6ae4772cd59696f280ff1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "唔……只有一线之隔吗！",
      "source_fingerprint": "8a03563e812a489f4c8bf7b5a2883f7d9e12bf9093d083401323081096bcd1bd",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1149",
        "1005"
      ]
    }
  ]
}
